.DS_Store
node_modules/
.next/
out/
.wrangler/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Local-only environment values and Cloudflare secrets.
.env*
.dev.vars*
!.env.example
!.dev.vars.example

# Build-generated live-content fallbacks. Canonical sources are data/*.json and
# root images/reviewN.*; prebuild recreates these mirrors for ASSETS fallback.
#
# The rule these three follow: a mirror of a PANEL-written file is ignored,
# because the panel commits the canonical file whenever it likes and the next
# build would otherwise leave a dirty tracked mirror every time. Mirrors of
# storefront-owned files (express-guide, bioscope-download) stay tracked — they
# only move when we move them. `public/products.json` is tracked despite being
# panel-written; that asymmetry predates this note and is an owner call.
public/data/faq.json
public/data/popular.json
public/data/reviews.json
public/images/review[0-9]*.webp
public/images/review[0-9]*.jpg
public/images/review[0-9]*.jpeg
public/images/review[0-9]*.png
